gy, Casey Eye Institute, Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU), Portland, Oregon, United States."}]}}, {"fullName": "Coyner AS", "lastName": "Coyner", "firstName": "Aaron S", "initials": "AS", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3261-1909"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Medical Informatics and Clinical Epidemiology, Oregon Health & Science University, Portland, Oregon, United States."}]}}, {"fullName": "Kalpathy-Cramer J", "lastName": "Kalpathy-Cramer", "firstName": "Jayashree", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8906-9618"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Athinoula A. Martinos Center for Biomedical Imaging, Department of Radiology, Massachusetts General Hospital, Charlestown, Massachusetts, United States."}]}}, {"fullName": "Chiang MF", "lastName": "Chiang", "firstName": "Michael F", "initials": "MF", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-8172-7636"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ophthalmology, Casey Eye Institute, Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU), Portland, Oregon, United States."}, {"affiliation": "Department of Medical Informatics and Clinical Epidemiology, Oregon Health & Science University, Portland, Oregon, United States."}]}}, {"fullName": "Campbell JP", "lastName": "Campbell", "firstName": "J Peter", "initials": "JP", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ophthalmology, Casey Eye Institute, Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU), Portland, Oregon, United States."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8906-9618"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-8172-7636"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3261-1909"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "2", "volume": "9", "journalIssueId": 2983856, "dat